        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "...Did you all have to start hanging out here this early?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman",
        "text": "What? There's just an hour and a half left until Maria's match! It's her first bout since her intensive training! There's no way I'd miss it!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_107",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin",
        "text": "Hahaha, well said. Everything is on the house today."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_107",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "*Sigh*... What a ruffian..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_107",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin",
        "text": "Here, your 'Thorn Tear.' It's not often you order something this strong. Are you worried about her?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_107",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "If I count from the day Zofia had me train her in swordsmanship, it took her four whole years to get to the preliminaries... But Maria only had four weeks."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "We should keep an eye on them. When it's time to call it quits, that's when they need to stop. We mustn't let them go overboard."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_107",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin",
        "text": "Hahaha... They're just a bunch of young, passionate knights. It brings me back to the time when Margaret decided to throw her name in the hat."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_107",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "But they are nothing like her."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_107",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin",
        "text": "Now, trust in her a little."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin",
        "text": "As long as she's creative with how she accumulates her points, getting qualified for the Major isn't really anything so difficult."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_107",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "That might work for your everyday contestants, but.. I'm not sure if that'll work for Maria..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "I have a feeling... there's going to be trouble."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman",
        "text": "What's the matter now, V? Why are you always pouring cold water on everything? What, are you jealous? Have you no shame?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
