    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob",
        "text": "Everyone! Please calm down! I know how excited you all are right now, but please try to calm down a little!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob",
        "text": "Try to give the young lady a little space. If she gets stage fright and calls it quits, the Roar Guards won't be issuing any refunds."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Greatmouth Mob",
        "text": "That's right! Support her with the cash in your wallets, not your voices! There's nothing more exciting than seeing your favorite knightess reign victorious thanks to your support, especially the monetary kind!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
