        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin",
        "text": "Looks like Greatmouth Mob got paid off by the Roar Guards."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_107",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "What a lowlife. *Spit*."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman",
        "text": "Heh, look at the Roar Guards trying to take on Raythean at their own game. They don't know their place, do they?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman",
        "text": "Even the putty I played with back when I was a kid lasts longer than the armors they churn out."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "Why don't I see you working at some big-name company, then?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman",
        "text": "Over my dead body! I've sworn off building equipment for knights!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "That's why you still haven't paid off your tab for a whole year already! Because you don't take work that pays."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman",
        "text": "I haven't picked up my tab because I've got bills to pay! Why else would I be fixing pipes? I'm not even a plumber!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_107",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Bald Marcin",
        "text": "Hahaha... Speaking of which, Old Lady Layla left you a message. She wants you to fix some lights for her son..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Knight",
        "text": "Well, are you going?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_120",
            "name2": "avg_npc_101",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Old Craftsman",
        "text": "I... err... Who's Maria up against?"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 1,
